values ('xero-workflows-for-virtual-assistants','Xero Workflows for Virtual Assistants','Independent Xero workflow training for VAs supporting Australian businesses, covering contacts, invoices, bills, bank feeds, reconciliation preparation, GST/BAS awareness, payroll handoffs, reporting, and accounting-review boundaries.','software','Australia',182,22,'draft',1,'Xero is a trademark of its respective owner. This independent course is not affiliated with, certified by, or endorsed by Xero. Product interfaces and features may change; verify current official Xero documentation.',null,null,null,now(),now())
